

========== x-qp. -qp はファイルの中を読むだけ。.rpm で終わる引数は rpm 4.16 ではファイルとして読まれる ==========

$ rpm -q labhello
labhello-1.0-1.noarch

$ rpm -qpi /srv/lab-rpm/labhello-1.0-1.noarch.rpm | grep -E '^(Name|Version|Install Date)'
Name        : labhello
Version     : 1.0
Install Date: (not installed)

$ rpm -qi labhello | grep -E '^(Name|Version|Install Date)'
Name        : labhello
Version     : 1.0
Install Date: Tue Oct 13 10:08:56 2026

$ rpm -q labtool; echo "exit=$?"
package labtool is not installed
exit=1

$ rpm -ql labtool; echo "exit=$?"
package labtool is not installed
exit=1

$ rpm -qpl /srv/lab-rpm/labtool-1.0-1.noarch.rpm
/usr/bin/labtool

$ rpm -ql /srv/lab-rpm/labtool-1.0-1.noarch.rpm; echo "exit=$?"
/usr/bin/labtool
exit=0

$ rpm --version
RPM version 4.16.1.3


========== x-repoquery. 入っていないパッケージの中身を目録から引く ==========

$ rpm -q labtool; echo "exit=$?"
package labtool is not installed
exit=1

$ yum repoquery -l labtool
Last metadata expiration check: 1:18:13 ago on Tue Oct 13 10:08:56 2026.
/usr/bin/labtool

$ ls -l /usr/bin/repoquery
lrwxrwxrwx 1 root root 22 Nov 12  2025 /usr/bin/repoquery -> /usr/libexec/dnf-utils

$ repoquery -l labtool
Last metadata expiration check: 1:18:13 ago on Tue Oct 13 10:08:56 2026.
/usr/bin/labtool

$ yum repoquery -l labapp liblab
Last metadata expiration check: 1:18:13 ago on Tue Oct 13 10:08:56 2026.
/etc/labapp.conf
/usr/bin/labapp
/usr/share/doc/labapp/README
/usr/lib/liblab/liblab.sh


